      "source": [
        "# Bike Rental Demand Analysis and Monte Carlo Simulation\n",
        "**Simulation and Modeling Lab (CSE 413)**\n",
        "\n",
        "**Goal:** Use historical hourly bike rentals to compare working and non-working days, study weather and demand, and simulate the probability of more than 500 or 800 rentals in an hour.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Dataset:** UCI Bike Sharing Dataset (2011–2012, Washington D.C. Capital Bikeshare). `cnt` is system-wide hourly rentals, not station inventory. [Dataset page](https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/275/bike+sharing+dataset).\n",
        "\n",
    
      ]
    },
